<title>JAPAN: Japan says no military action against Iraq yet.</title>
<headline>Japan says no military action against Iraq yet.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's top government spokesman said on Tuesday that no military action had been taken against Iraq for its incursion against the Kurds &quot;as of yet&quot;.</p>
</text>
